    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis spacious detached family home with adjoining granny flat is set in a scenic coastal area close to Roonagh Point and 5.7 kilometres from Louisburgh town. \n\nThe original house was built circa 1994, while the granny flat was built at a later stage circa 2004 extending the total floor area to 257.3 sq m/2,769.5 sq ft. The own front door flat can be accessed directly from the main home, making it perfect for extended family, guests, or extra living space. \n\nThe property has been well maintained and is presented in good condition throughout. Accommodation in the main house comprises of entrance hallway, living room, kitchen/ dining/family room with a double sided inset stove, utility, four bedrooms (one en-suite) and a bathroom. \n\nThe granny flat is laid out over ground and first floors. Its accommodation comprises of entrance hall, kitchen/dining/living room, utility, four bedrooms (one ensuite), wheelchair accessible shower room and a further two rooms, suitable for a range of uses such as a home office, study, or hobby space. This would be an ideal opportunity to glean additional income from this space. \n\nExternally, the house sits on a large site of approximately 2.74 acres/ 1.11 hectares.\n\nThe property benefits from separate heating systems and ESB connections for both he main house and the granny flat. This set up makes it particularly well suited to a large family, multi-generational living, or potential rental use\n\nLocation\nThe property is located 5.7 km from Louisburgh, an attractive small town with primary and secondary schools, shops, restaurants and bars. A number of excellent beaches are within a short drive and Westport town is 20 kilometres distance. \n\nThe property is just 1.5 kilometres from the shoreline, with easy access to Emlagh and Carrownisky beaches. It's an ideal location for anyone who enjoys outdoor activities, with plenty of leisure options close by.\n\nOFFERS IN EXCESS OF 479,000"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.6m x 2.0m\nFrench pine floors, built in storage units\n\nLiving Room - 4.9m x 3.95m\nBleached oak laminate, double sided inset stove, curtains\n\nKitchen/Dining - 7.2m x 4.15m\nOak laminate floor, tiled backsplash, ivory painted kitchen with integrated gas hob and eye level electric oven, free standing American fridge freezer and dishwasher, patio doors to rear garden\n\nUtility Room - 3.08m x 2.38m\nTiled floor, built in units\n\nBedroom One - 3.14m x 2.9m\nFrench pine floors, built in units, curtains\n\nBathroom - 3.2m x 1.62m\nFully tiled, bath, sink unit, wc\n\nHotpress - 1.8m x 1.3m\nFully shelved\n\nBedroom Two - 3.03m x 2.9m\nFrench pine floor, built in wardrobe, curtains\n\nBedroom Three - 3.9m x 3.2m\nFrench pine floor, built in wardrobe, curtains\n\nEn-Suite - 1.85m x 1.8m\nFully tiled, sink unit, wc\n\nBedroom Four - 3.9m x 2.95m\nBeech laminate floor, blinds, curtains\n\nGRANNY FLAT - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - 3.9m x 2.1m\nTiled floor, partial french pine floor, stairs to first floor\n\nKitchen/Living/Dining - 7.0m x 5.8m\nSolid oak floor, partial tiled floor (kitchen), local stone fireplace, stove, oak kitchen, integrated oven/hob\n\nUtility Room - 2.3m x 1.6m\nPVC units\n\nShower Room - 2.45m x 2.0m\nFully tiled, wheel chair access, whb, wc\n\nBedroom One - 4.3m x 3.2m\nFrench pine floor, built in wardrobe, curtains\n\nFirst Floor Landing & Hallway - 3.7m x 1.2m & 7.6m x 1.2m\nLamintate floor, velux windows x 2\n\nBedroom Two - 3.3m x 3.2m\nOak laminate floor, built in storage, curtains\n\nBedroom Three - 5.2m x 3.2m\nOak laminate floor, built in storage, curtains\n\nRoom One - 3.0m x 2.1m\n\n\nRoom Two - 3.0m x 2.1m\n\n\nBedroom Four - 3.6m x 3.1m\nLaminate floor, velux\n\nEn-Suite - 1.85m x 1.75m\nFully tiled, whb, wc, velux\n\n"
